    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of corporate management where dreams are built, and spaces are transformed into lucrative opportunities. In &quot;<strong>The Dream Office</strong>,&quot; you step into the polished shoes of a seasoned manager with a flair for turning commercial spaces, especially office buildings, into thriving hubs of productivity. But it's not just about desks and chairs; it's about making strategic decisions, from cleaning up the mess to sealing the perfect deal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/6a8beb612fd16869d61eaf19d6780efb.poster.avif?t=1750345857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/6a8beb612fd16869d61eaf19d6780efb.webm?t=1750345857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/6a8beb612fd16869d61eaf19d6780efb.mp4?t=1750345857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8<strong>1. Creative Mode - Sandbox:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity in the sandbox mode. Design and create your own rooms, transforming a large open space into a unique and personalized environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/1dcd7ae3cfa2dc6495db16efce36b36c.poster.avif?t=1750345857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/1dcd7ae3cfa2dc6495db16efce36b36c.webm?t=1750345857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/1dcd7ae3cfa2dc6495db16efce36b36c.mp4?t=1750345857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<strong>2. Immersive Mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in various activities such as cleaning up garbage, leveling walls, painting, laying tiles, washing, and equipping spaces. Selling unnecessary items adds an additional layer of strategy to your management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe2<strong>3. Diverse Spaces to Manage:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From offices and fitness facilities to toilets, corridors, and utility rooms, each space presents its own set of challenges and opportunities. Manage them wisely to build your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/a1cfbcc81ced485abc906724d5d050d0.poster.avif?t=1750345857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/a1cfbcc81ced485abc906724d5d050d0.webm?t=1750345857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/a1cfbcc81ced485abc906724d5d050d0.mp4?t=1750345857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0<strong>4. Maximize Profits Through Strategic Management:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the manager of various commercial spaces, your goal is to adapt and maximize profits by renting out the available space. Clean, renovate, and equip your buildings with the latest amenities to attract high-paying tenants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8<strong>5. Navigate Rental Offers and Make Strategic Decisions:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regularly receive offers from companies willing to rent specific rooms. Meet their conditions, decide on the right tenants, and optimize income to keep your cash flow steady.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc<strong>6. Daily Hustle for Success:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money on a daily basis by actively managing your spaces. Work during the day, rent out rooms and make strategic decisions to boost your income. Don't forget to keep your spaces clean and reputation intact to avoid penalties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/f37c5b9bd8da7a00d2865fdaffe3276f.poster.avif?t=1750345857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/f37c5b9bd8da7a00d2865fdaffe3276f.webm?t=1750345857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/f37c5b9bd8da7a00d2865fdaffe3276f.mp4?t=1750345857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10<strong>7. Unlock and Expand:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress by renovating your office building and unlock new spaces. Once you reach a certain level, you can unlock or buy another building, offering fresh challenges and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/1b7e237301e1a772e3f196a9015b13cc.poster.avif?t=1750345857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/1b7e237301e1a772e3f196a9015b13cc.webm?t=1750345857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/1b7e237301e1a772e3f196a9015b13cc.mp4?t=1750345857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2<strong>8. Fame Currency and In-Game Store:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn &quot;fame&quot; as you progress, a currency used to unlock premium equipment in the in-game store. Choose wisely to enhance your buildings and attract high-profile tenants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey of strategic decision-making, creativity, and space management. Will you create the most sought-after commercial spaces and become the ultimate office tycoon? The Dream Office awaits your management prowess!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of corporate management where dreams are built, and spaces are transformed into lucrative opportunities. In &quot;<strong>The Dream Office</strong>,&quot; you step into the polished shoes of a seasoned manager with a flair for turning commercial spaces, especially office buildings, into thriving hubs of productivity. But it's not just about desks and chairs; it's about making strategic decisions, from cleaning up the mess to sealing the perfect deal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/6a8beb612fd16869d61eaf19d6780efb.poster.avif?t=1750345857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/6a8beb612fd16869d61eaf19d6780efb.webm?t=1750345857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/6a8beb612fd16869d61eaf19d6780efb.mp4?t=1750345857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8<strong>1. Creative Mode - Sandbox:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity in the sandbox mode. Design and create your own rooms, transforming a large open space into a unique and personalized environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/1dcd7ae3cfa2dc6495db16efce36b36c.poster.avif?t=1750345857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/1dcd7ae3cfa2dc6495db16efce36b36c.webm?t=1750345857\" type=\"vi